1
00:00:00,806 --> 00:00:02,806
(Raj:)Run, run, run. Don't look back.

2
00:00:02,975 --> 00:00:05,815
(Leonard:)I thought we had something special.

3
00:00:10,107 --> 00:00:12,107
(Raj(locks door):)So you say you can't pay your rent?

4
00:00:20,784 --> 00:00:22,244
(Penny:)-Oh, Leonard?
-Hey.

5
00:00:22,453 --> 00:00:23,783
(Penny:)I found these in the dryer.

6
00:00:23,954 --> 00:00:25,874
(Penny:)I'm assuming they belong to Sheldon.

7
00:00:26,999 --> 00:00:30,289
(Leonard:)Thanks. It's really hard
to find these in his size.

8
00:00:32,087 --> 00:00:33,127
(Leonard:)So listen.

9
00:00:33,297 --> 00:00:36,007
(Leonard:)I've been meaning to talk to you
about the other morning.

10
00:00:36,175 --> 00:00:38,675
PENNY:
You mean you and Dr. Slutbunny?

11
00:00:39,094 --> 00:00:40,974
(Leonard:)Yeah, I wanted to explain.

12
00:00:41,138 --> 00:00:43,138
No. You don't owe me an explanation.

13
00:00:43,307 --> 00:00:45,437
(Leonard:)-I don't?
-No, you don't.

14
00:00:45,601 --> 00:00:47,141
(Leonard:)So you're not judging me?

15
00:00:47,311 --> 00:00:49,311
PENNY: Oh, I'm judging you
nine ways to Sunday...

16
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,900
(Penny:)...but you don't owe me
an explanation.

17
00:00:52,608 --> 00:00:54,988
(Leonard:)Nevertheless, I'd like to get one
on the record...

18
00:00:55,152 --> 00:00:57,862
(Leonard:)...so you can understand
why I did what I did.

19
00:00:58,030 --> 00:01:00,070
(Penny:)I'm listening.

20
00:01:06,747 --> 00:01:08,627
(Leonard:)She let me.

